      "text": {
        "jp": "そっか。わかった。\r\nまずはこの洞窟の奥を目指して\r\n水の巫女を助け出そう。",
        "official_en": "I see. So we have to go deep into the cave and rescue the Maiden.",
        "real_en": "I see. Okay. Let’s head deeper into the cave and rescue the Water Maiden first."
