      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それが穢れたということは\r\n水の巫女になにかあったのかもしれません。",
        "official_en": "If that water is now corrupted, something must have happened to her.",
        "real_en": "If the water has become tainted, something might have happened to the Water Maiden."
